{
  "name": "Generate daily AI posts for Bluesky and Mastodon",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Generate daily AI posts for Bluesky and Mastodon\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs automatically every day.\n2. Sets the post theme that guide the AI-written content.\n3. Uses OpenAI to write the post copy and parses it into per-platform fields.\n4. Publishes posts to Bluesky and Mastodon via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] In the Set post theme node, set the post theme to your own content.\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n\n### Customization\n\nEdit the prompt in the AI Daily Post Generator node, or change the OpenAI model, to tune the tone of the copy. Try different topics and tones in the Set node to see how the AI adapts the copy per platform.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 610
      },
      "id": "3d8f9d63-41c8-47af-922a-10c44060e8e1",
